<h1><%= t('contact.title') %></h1>
<p><%= t('contact.intro') %></p>
<p><%- t('contact.prefer_email', {email: '<a href="mailto:mikekelleyii.mk2@gmail.com">mikekelleyii.mk2@gmail.com</a>'}) %></p>
<form method="post" action="/contact" class="stack">
  <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
  <label><%= t('contact.name') %>
    <input type="text" name="name" maxlength="120" required>
  </label>
  <label><%= t('contact.email') %>
    <input type="email" name="email" maxlength="120" required>
  </label>
  <label><%= t('contact.topic') %>
    <select name="topic">
      <option value="order"><%= t('contact.topic_order') %></option>
      <option value="custom"><%= t('contact.topic_custom') %></option>
      <option value="artist"><%= t('contact.topic_artist') %></option>
      <option value="shop"><%= t('contact.topic_shop') %></option>
      <option value="other"><%= t('contact.topic_other') %></option>
    </select>
  </label>
  <label><%= t('contact.message') %>
    <textarea name="message" rows="6" maxlength="2000" required></textarea>
  </label>
  <button class="btn" type="submit"><%= t('contact.send') %></button>
</form>

<h2>Get an answer faster</h2>
<p>Most questions we get are already answered in the guides — checking there first usually beats waiting on a reply:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/guides/aftercare">The complete tattoo aftercare guide</a> — healing timelines, what to use, what to avoid.</li>
  <li><a href="/guides/choosing-a-design">How to choose a tattoo design that ages well</a> — size, placement, and line weight, explained.</li>
  <li><a href="/guides/custom-design-process">How custom designs work, step by step</a> — deposit, drawing, delivery, and revisions.</li>
  <li><a href="/guides/for-tattoo-shops">For tattoo shops</a> — memberships, referrals, and running your shop on Tattoo Art Customs.</li>
</ul>
<p>Writing about an order? Include your order number (it is in your confirmation email and on your <a href="/account">account page</a>) so we can pull it up in one step. Selling your art or signing up a shop — pick that topic above and tell us where to see your work.</p>
